# A write by a path in the code of a callable writes the Structure of its data itself (plan M11 5b; R20): the next
# call and a read from outside see what was written.
fn: f () int (
    Point(int: x 1)
)
    Point\x := Point\x + 1
    return: Point\x
end: f
int: first f()
int: second f()
int: outside f\data\Point\x
